final_justification.value:
Clearly reasons to accept outweigh reasons to reject, but with a margin that is not very high:
- It's a new principled and elegant method that seems to work better than others on an important class of problems;
- The evaluation, however, didn't allow me to fully confirm the superiority of the new method. Many concerns were addressed by the authors, and I find myself directionally agreeing with their arguments, but they still didn't fully allow me to validate the evaluation methodology and results. If it wasn't for this, I would have put 5/6, because the other parts of the work are solid.

